    "name": "Rage of Mechs",
    "steam_appid": 2518000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/0fcfba81118af115185ed012ae972116.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/0fcfba81118af115185ed012ae972116.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Rage of Mechs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage of Mechs is a turn-based strategy game inspired by classics like XCOM, Jagged Alliance, Fallout, Heroes of Might and Magic III, and BattleTech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in early alpha. A lot of core systems are already in place, but we\u2019re just getting started. We have big plans ahead and a clear development roadmap to guide them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/0e07d9dcda7d03784b14971d2ebb7187.avif?t=1751886439\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Assembly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no hard limits on the number of units in your squad\u2014only weight. Each weapon and module adds to the total weight of your Mech, and the combined weight of all your Mechs determines your team\u2019s limit. Balancing firepower, utility, and mobility is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/b2034fb43205c7ac088890bfb32bef57.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/b2034fb43205c7ac088890bfb32bef57.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Mech</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Mech is fully modular and uniquely customizable. Inspired by the way firearms are assembled in real life \u2014 with attachments like grips, silencers, and optics \u2014 we\u2019ve built a system that lets you swap out weapons, engines, armor, cooling systems, camouflage units, radar arrays, and more. Each choice affects performance on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/048c9bc600d4813fe2dfce34c2ce2909.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/048c9bc600d4813fe2dfce34c2ce2909.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pilots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Mech is piloted by a Paladin \u2014 a warrior bonded to their machine. While pilot abilities, factions, and mood systems are still under development, our goal is to introduce specialized skills, interpersonal relationships, and faction-based buffs and debuffs. Paladins will be more than stats \u2014 they\u2019ll be characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/0952f3f82d11dba3a72ba64b19225d5b.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/0952f3f82d11dba3a72ba64b19225d5b.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer, Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re passionate about turn-based gameplay and wanted to bring it into a competitive, multiplayer setting. Rage of Mechs blends tactical depth with head-to-head battles, where every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/bdb933dfd23bb569200ffd2f38a2f6b6.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/bdb933dfd23bb569200ffd2f38a2f6b6.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environments and Tactical Terrain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve implemented dynamic maps with day/night cycles and varying terrain types. At night, visibility is reduced \u2014 just like in real life \u2014 making ambushes and stealth tactics more viable. Forests slow your movement but improve camouflage. Water cools your Mech but can be dangerous to cross. Terrain isn\u2019t just decoration; it\u2019s part of your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/7528cb785316110e4a0630ddc9052628.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/7528cb785316110e4a0630ddc9052628.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re building Rage of Mechs alongside our players. Your feedback, ideas, and insights are vital to us. Join our official Discord and help shape the game. We want to create something great\u2014with you, not just for you! Join today and become a Paladin :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/61428823fdae84cda91024eba7b6d431.avif?t=1751886439\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/0fcfba81118af115185ed012ae972116.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/0fcfba81118af115185ed012ae972116.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Rage of Mechs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage of Mechs is a turn-based strategy game inspired by classics like XCOM, Jagged Alliance, Fallout, Heroes of Might and Magic III, and BattleTech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in early alpha. A lot of core systems are already in place, but we\u2019re just getting started. We have big plans ahead and a clear development roadmap to guide them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/0e07d9dcda7d03784b14971d2ebb7187.avif?t=1751886439\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Assembly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no hard limits on the number of units in your squad\u2014only weight. Each weapon and module adds to the total weight of your Mech, and the combined weight of all your Mechs determines your team\u2019s limit. Balancing firepower, utility, and mobility is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/b2034fb43205c7ac088890bfb32bef57.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/b2034fb43205c7ac088890bfb32bef57.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Mech</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Mech is fully modular and uniquely customizable. Inspired by the way firearms are assembled in real life \u2014 with attachments like grips, silencers, and optics \u2014 we\u2019ve built a system that lets you swap out weapons, engines, armor, cooling systems, camouflage units, radar arrays, and more. Each choice affects performance on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/048c9bc600d4813fe2dfce34c2ce2909.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/048c9bc600d4813fe2dfce34c2ce2909.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pilots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Mech is piloted by a Paladin \u2014 a warrior bonded to their machine. While pilot abilities, factions, and mood systems are still under development, our goal is to introduce specialized skills, interpersonal relationships, and faction-based buffs and debuffs. Paladins will be more than stats \u2014 they\u2019ll be characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/0952f3f82d11dba3a72ba64b19225d5b.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/0952f3f82d11dba3a72ba64b19225d5b.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer, Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re passionate about turn-based gameplay and wanted to bring it into a competitive, multiplayer setting. Rage of Mechs blends tactical depth with head-to-head battles, where every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/bdb933dfd23bb569200ffd2f38a2f6b6.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/bdb933dfd23bb569200ffd2f38a2f6b6.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environments and Tactical Terrain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve implemented dynamic maps with day/night cycles and varying terrain types. At night, visibility is reduced \u2014 just like in real life \u2014 making ambushes and stealth tactics more viable. Forests slow your movement but improve camouflage. Water cools your Mech but can be dangerous to cross. Terrain isn\u2019t just decoration; it\u2019s part of your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/7528cb785316110e4a0630ddc9052628.poster.webp?t=1751886439\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/7528cb785316110e4a0630ddc9052628.webp?t=1751886439\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re building Rage of Mechs alongside our players. Your feedback, ideas, and insights are vital to us. Join our official Discord and help shape the game. We want to create something great\u2014with you, not just for you! Join today and become a Paladin :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518000/extras/61428823fdae84cda91024eba7b6d431.avif?t=1751886439\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
